        "description": "Identification of pathogenic variants in the CK gene",
        "category": "major",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": true
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of severe intellectual disability, congenital renal anomalies, and pathogenic CK gene variant",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is confirmed by genetic testing; clinical features support diagnosis."
